{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":48.040000915527344,"text":"A king fell gravely ill and promised that if he recovered, he would build a splendid church. He recovered, and the architect designed a building with a dome you can see from a long way off. But as soon as it was finished, the French Revolution broke out, and the people decided to use it differently, as a resting place for those the country wished to honor. Writers, scientists, and thinkers lie here. The most thrilling thing, though, hangs from the dome. In 1851, Leon Foucault hung a 28-kilo ball here on a wire 67 meters long and let it swing. Over the course of a day, the plane of its swing slowly turned. The pendulum was not turning. The building was, and the whole earth with it.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"king","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"fell","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"gravely","start":1.340000033378601,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"ill","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"and","start":2.240000009536743,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"promised","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3.299999952316284},{"word":"that","start":3.299999952316284,"end":3.619999885559082},{"word":"if","start":3.619999885559082,"end":3.759999990463257},{"word":"he","start":3.759999990463257,"end":4.179999828338623},{"word":"recovered","start":4.179999828338623,"end":4.320000171661377},{"word":"he","start":4.840000152587891,"end":4.980000019073486},{"word":"would","start":4.980000019073486,"end":5.199999809265137},{"word":"build","start":5.199999809265137,"end":5.5},{"word":"a","start":5.5,"end":5.940000057220459},{"word":"splendid","start":5.940000057220459,"end":6.340000152587891},{"word":"church","start":6.340000152587891,"end":6.78000020980835},{"word":"He","start":7.360000133514404,"end":7.539999961853027},{"word":"recovered","start":7.539999961853027,"end":7.920000076293945